 "sentences": [
  "Paleontologists fought a brutal dinosaur war.",
  "Edward Drinker Cope and Othniel Charles Marsh were bitter rivals.",
  "They used bribery, theft, and the destruction of valuable bones.",
  "Both men constantly attacked each other in publications to cut funding.",
  "From 1877 to 1892, they heavily financed rival western expeditions.",
  "They completely ruined themselves financially while making massive contributions to science."
